title: Tuto_Intro
position: 0,0.5
---
Astère : Bulle, it's time to dip your toes in the water! This is your trial, for now is the tutorial!
->Bulle : Yeeeeees !!
    Astère : Non-tutorial mode activated ? Are you sure, Bulle? 
    Astère : No, I'm just kidding, I'll help you... there's not much to do on your forehead. 
    Astère : So Bulle, in this world there's a lot to know. You jump with RT and you pick up resources with X.
    Bulle : And what about the other things ?
    Astère : Slow down little genius, that’s what a tutorial is made for !
->Bulle : No.
    Astère : Oh you there behind your screen! Do you really want to skip the tutorial? 
    Astère : Don't complain when you don't know how to craft!
    ->Yes, skip the tutorial.
            <<SkipTuto>>
    ->No, don't skip the tutorial.
        Astère : Oh, thank you, there is a purpose to my presence on your foreheah!
        Astère : So Bulle, in this world there's a lot to know. You jump with RT and you pick up resources with X.
        Bulle : And what about the other things ?
        Astère : Slow down little genius, that’s what a tutorial is made for !
===
title: Tuto_PoupleCoussin
position: 0,0.5
---
Astère: This big orange thing is a Pillow Octopus, it's like a giant trampoline, you can jump on it with RT
Bulle : You know a lot of things for someone who has lived all her life on my forehead... 
===
title: Tuto_Planage
position: 0,0.5
---
Astère : Oh no, this platform is too far... If only we could glide...
Astère: Oh, but we can! Just keep pressing RT. 
===
title: Tuto_Fruit
position: 0,0.5
---
Astère : Five little monkeys jumping on the bed...
Astère : One fell down and bumped his head...
Astère : Mama called the doctor and the doctor said...
Astère : Oh not five monkeys but three bananas! jump up and press X to grab them!
===
title: Tuto_Planage_Fail
position: 0,0.5
---
Astère : Bulle, if you can't even glide, you can go straight back to mommy and daddy.
===
title: Tuto_Banane
position: 0,0.5
---
Astère : You could say you're up against the wall here. 
Astère : How about making your own Pillow Octopus to bounce on? You remember how to open your waist bag, I hope? 
===
title: Tuto_Craft_Intro
position: 0,0.5
---
<<LockInput>>
Astère : Surprise test ! To craft a Pillow Octopus you need: an octopus and a...
Bulle : Pillow ?
Astère : Eh no, a fruit. You're not very smart, Bulle...
Astère : Select an octopus and put it in the shaker, it's the purple thing on the right here. 
<<UnlockInput>>
