title: Tuto_Craft_Item_Good
position: 0,0.5
---
<<LockInput>>
Astère : Perfect, now turn the right joystick with all of your strength!
Bulle : What does joystick mean?
Astère : It means shaker in octopus language.
Bulle : Really?
Astère : Don't ask questions.
<<UnlockInput>>
===
title: Tuto_Craft_Item_Bad
position: 0,0.5
---
<<LockInput>>
Astère : Bulle, don't you know how to recognize resources? You should think about getting diving glasses, it might help. 
Astère : You need an octopus and a fruit! You can undo your mistake by pressing and holding B.
<<UnlockInput>>
===
title: Tuto_Craft_Fin
position: 0,0.5
---
<<LockInput>>
Astère : I hope you remembered the recipe, because trust me, you're going to need it. 
Astère : Press A or X twice to place it.
<<UnlockInput>>
