===
title: Tuto_FleurBrulante
position: 0,0.5
---
Astère : Another obstacle... It's almost like they are doing it on purpose!
Astère : Open your banana with Y and look for burning flowers. We're going to tear down this wall !!!!
===
title: Tuto_FleurBrulante_Active
position: 0,0.5
---
Astère : And now, press A or X next to the wall ! Look like we are on FIRE today!
===
title: Tuto_Geyser
