title: Tuto_Final
position: 0,0.5
---
Astère : Ah! We're finally done with this endless tutorial! 
Bulle :  Now, let's go to the city!
Astère : According to Water Maps, you have to cross a wreck and then a cemetery to get there. 
<<ObjectiveNotif "NONE1f">>
===
title: Tuto_FinalNul
position: 0,0.5
---
Astère : You're really a party wetter, Bulle... You do know there is no fall damage?
===
title: Tuto_CraftLock
position: 0,0.5
---
<<LockInput>>
<<if dice(3) == 1>>
Astère : No luck! You need a recipie to craft this!
<<elseif dice(3) == 2>>
Astère : Sir Alchemist, I beg of you! Calm down! You didn't discover this object's recipe yet.
<<else>>
Astère : If you had the recipe, it would make for a great object!
<<endif>>
<<UnlockInput>>
