title: Tuto_CourantMarin
position: 34,210
---
Astère : The best thing in the ocean! A marine current!
Bulle : How am I supposed to get inside?
Astère : Easy peasy Bulle...
<<SetSpeed 50>>
Astère : so just press A while walking, 3 seconds later you press ZL 6 times at regular intervals, exactly 1 second later you just do a backflip towards the north east entrance of the current while turning your left joystick counter-clockwise! 
<<wait 0.5>>
Astère : Just kidding, you just have to jump in. 
